Files extracted with conditions written in different ways can be merged:
  a.mcpl (-e "pdgcode == neutron and ekin > 5000 eV"): mcpltool: extracted particles with -e "pdgcode==neutron and ekin>5keV"
  b.mcpl (-e "(pdgcode==2112) and ekin>5keV"): mcpltool: extracted particles with -e "pdgcode==neutron and ekin>5keV"
  merged.mcpl: 5 + 5 = 10 particles
